{
  "about": [
    "One cue stack and a list of cases, read by two test suites:",
    "crates/pult-schema/src/types/cue.rs's `tracked_through` and the",
    "`trackedThrough` in frontend/src/lib/cues.ts. \"A cue is the stack up to it\"",
    "is the rule the whole cue sheet draws — hard against tracked, and which cue a",
    "tracked value came from — and the browser cannot round-trip to ask, because a",
    "cue clicked in a list has to colour a sheet in the same frame.",
    "",
    "Each case names the cue ids a sequence lists up to and including the one being",
    "looked at, and expects the latest capture of every key, in the order the keys",
    "were first seen. That order is part of the answer: a HashMap's is not stable,",
    "and a sheet whose rows moved between two identical questions would be a sheet",
    "nobody could read.",
    "",
    "Cue 9 is in `cues` and in no case's `through` except case five, which passes an",
    "id the lookup answers nothing for — a sequence naming a deleted cue, which is a",
    "show mid-edit and not a reason to answer nothing."
  ],
